+The `inputSchema` follows [JSON Schema](https://json-schema.org/) format. The model uses this to construct the correct input, and the registry enforces it: every call is validated against the schema before the executor runs, so a schema that does not describe what your executor needs is a bug that reaches production.
 
 - Use `required` to mark mandatory fields
 - Add `description` to each property -- the model reads these
